# Env
.env
*.log
# ECS log files the backend and BFF write (issue #275). Anchored: only the repo-root output
# dir. *.log above misses the rotated archives (pricehunt-backend.log.2026-09-17.0.gz).
# The directory itself is kept (#277): Alloy bind-mounts it, and on Linux a missing bind source is
# created root-owned by the daemon, which the host-run apps then cannot write into.
/logs/*
!/logs/.gitkeep

